bbae, https://si.imgix.net/1304ac77/uploads/origins/e8b90f26-a238-41f6-a5cc-4c8c6e7028d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eae417cc19373a790997a2b40a9f2fd3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1304ac77/uploads/origins/e8b90f26-a238-41f6-a5cc-4c8c6e7028d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c6464dbcd3525cc0d89ec4143cda915 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, please excuse the sudden request! I saw your artwork and I love how pretty it is and how you draw women! I would like to request for you to draw my one character. She is an older sister type fox who wears red glasses and has blonde hair. Please note the beauty mark under her lip as well. \n\nI would like for her to wear a red dress you think she would look good in. Please feel free to choose any pose and expression as well, but I would like the image to be alluring. \n\nThank you for your consideration! \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XTDbqDFYm3_xccyElOafQSWVgenKES1-?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiragi_amo/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d4dc18b/uploads/origins/7a04e92c-d775-4ca4-91f1-0237cda71c04?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3b5418ec992b95174c09755d578db092", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4d4dc18b/uploads/origins/7a04e92c-d775-4ca4-91f1-0237cda71c04?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3b5418ec992b95174c09755d578db092, https://si.imgix.net/4d4dc18b/uploads/origins/7a04e92c-d775-4ca4-91f1-0237cda71c04?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3c092e74ac50b93